(    OPINION AS TO VALIDITY OF ?PUTS,? ?CALLS,? &c.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(                                         Law Offices of SIMON STERNE,) Tj T*
(                                                   29 William Street,) Tj T*
(                                           NEW YORK, July 24th, 1886.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    H. W. ROSENBAUM, ESQ., 60 Exchange Place, New York,) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    DEAR SIR:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    You ask my opinion as to time contracts known as ?puts,?) Tj T*
(    ?calls,? and ?straddles? or ?spreads,? in relation to stocks,) Tj T*
(    bonds, etc. The inquiry is prompted by the apprehension that) Tj T*
(    such contracts may be regarded by the law as of a gambling) Tj T*
(    character, and therefore not enforceable.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    Contracts partake of the nature of wagers only when there is no) Tj T*
(    intention either to deliver or to receive the goods, stocks,) Tj T*
(    or bonds, which form the subject matter of the contract. That) Tj T*
(    in point of fact and as a matter of local custom, differences) Tj T*
(    are sometimes paid on the settlement of time contracts instead) Tj T*
(    of delivery being actually made, does not affect the original) Tj T*
(    transaction, and does not invalidate it. So long as there was) Tj T*
(    not a clear intention, either express or implied, that the) Tj T*
(    things themselves were not, under any circumstances, either to) Tj T*
(    be called for or to be delivered, and so long as the holder) Tj T*
(    of the ?call? has the right to demand the actual delivery of) Tj T*
(    the stocks or bonds mentioned in the contract, or the holder) Tj T*
(    of the ?put? has the right to insist upon the actual delivery) Tj T*
(    of the stocks, bonds or merchandise represented by the ?put,?) Tj T*
(    the transaction can, in no sense, be considered a gambling one) Tj T*
(    or partake of the nature of a wager, although, instead of the) Tj T*
(    actual delivery, differences may and sometimes are, as a matter) Tj T*
(    of compromise, accepted for convenience, at the time when the) Tj T*
ET
